      "subject": "fix(learning): the first learning check runs a minute after Runtime starts (F-32)",
      "body": "The scheduler only checked after a full 30-minute interval of uptime. During development Runtime restarts with every patch, so no cycle ran after SEC-1d: seven owner commits went unlearned, and MS-2026-0001 never received the commits carrying its Mission trailer. The first check now runs one minute after start, then every interval; stopping cancels it and an interval of 0 still turns checks off.\n\nMission: MS-2026-0001\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01AHtXdN7VRusNxTFHzk5uFe",
